Subject: [PATCH v9 05/20] platform/x86/intel/pmt: Do not remap when using
 callbacks
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 13:11:43 -0700
Message-ID: <20260916201139.2374531-27-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
